{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11589","headline":"自瀼西荆扉且移居东屯茅屋四首 四 · 杜甫","name":"自瀼西荆扉且移居东屯茅屋四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牢落西江外，参差北户间。\n久游巴子国，卧病楚人山。\n幽独移佳境，清深隔远关。\n寒空见鸳鹭，回首忆朝班。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}